{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"Praise|strong=\"H1984\"the|strong=\"H3068\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"!  \nSing|strong=\"H7891\"to|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3068\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"a|strong=\"H3068\"new|strong=\"H2319\"song|strong=\"H7892\",  \nhis|strong=\"H3068\"praise|strong=\"H1984\"in|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3068\"assembly|strong=\"H6951\"of|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3068\"saints|strong=\"H2623\".   \n"},{"number":2,"text":"Let|strong=\"H8055\"Israel|strong=\"H3478\"rejoice|strong=\"H8055\"in|strong=\"H3478\"him|strong=\"H6213\"who|strong=\"H1121\"made|strong=\"H6213\"them|strong=\"H6213\".  \nLet|strong=\"H8055\"the|strong=\"H6213\"children|strong=\"H1121\"of|strong=\"H1121\"Zion|strong=\"H6726\"be|strong=\"H1121\"joyful|strong=\"H1523\"in|strong=\"H3478\"their|strong=\"H6213\"King|strong=\"H4428\".   \n"},{"number":3,"text":"Let them praise|strong=\"H1984\"his|strong=\"H8034\"name|strong=\"H8034\"in|strong=\"H8034\"the|strong=\"H1984\"dance|strong=\"H4234\"!  \nLet them sing|strong=\"H2167\"praises|strong=\"H2167\"to|strong=\"H8034\"him|strong=\"H1984\"with|strong=\"H8034\"tambourine|strong=\"H8596\"and|strong=\"H3658\"harp|strong=\"H3658\"!   \n"},{"number":4,"text":"For|strong=\"H3588\"the|strong=\"H3588\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"takes|strong=\"H7521\"pleasure|strong=\"H7521\"in|strong=\"H3068\"his|strong=\"H3068\"people|strong=\"H5971\".  \nHe|strong=\"H3588\"crowns the|strong=\"H3588\"humble|strong=\"H6035\"with|strong=\"H3068\"salvation|strong=\"H3444\".   \n"},{"number":5,"text":"Let the|strong=\"H5921\"saints|strong=\"H2623\"rejoice|strong=\"H7442\"in|strong=\"H5921\"honor|strong=\"H3519\".  \nLet them|strong=\"H5921\"sing|strong=\"H7442\"for|strong=\"H5921\"joy|strong=\"H7442\"on|strong=\"H5921\"their|strong=\"H5921\"beds|strong=\"H4904\".   \n"},{"number":6,"text":"May|strong=\"H2719\"the|strong=\"H3027\"high|strong=\"H7319\"praises of|strong=\"H3027\"God|strong=\"H3027\"be|strong=\"H3027\"in|strong=\"H3027\"their|strong=\"H3027\"mouths,  \nand